weave ritual new_float_set into Set of float:
    var s as Set of float with:
        set .items is map of float to int
    return s

## Creates an empty `Set of bool`.
##
## ## Parámetros
## - None.
##
## ## Retorno
## An owned empty `Set of bool`. Release its backing map with `banish s.items`.
